---
description: Follow the Funkies254 pre-launch spec before changing the product
alwaysApply: true
---

Before changing models, API behaviour, or pages, read `docs/SPEC.md`,
`docs/DATABASE.md`, and `docs/API.md`.

- Schema changes go through Django migrations only. Do not hand-edit Supabase.
- On-site registration stays closed: `POST /api/registrations/` returns 410 and
  the UI sends visitors to the organiser's `https://` link.
- Agent-created events are never auto-verified. Approving or rejecting a
  proposal writes `AdminActivityLog`.
- Keep existing tests passing unless `docs/SPEC.md` intentionally changes the
  contract, and update the docs in the same change.
